  "items": [
    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2017–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2017–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The column name for key columns of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a> or <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> collections in the corresponding relationship table.\nThe attribute supports Value Expressions to dynamically obtain the column name on a per-operation basis. Defaults\nto <a href=\"NamingStrategy.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>NamingStrategy</code></a> usage if the value is empty. Expressions returning a <code>String</code> are\n<a href=\"SqlIdentifierSanitizer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>sanitized</code></a> prior usage. Expressions can also return a\n<a href=\"../sql/SqlIdentifier.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>SqlIdentifier</code></a> directly that is used as-is without further\nsanitization.",
      "translation": "对应关系表中，用于 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a> 或 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>` 集合的关键列的列名。\n该属性支持值表达式，以便在每次操作时动态获取列名。如果值为空，则默认使用 `<a href=\"NamingStrategy.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>NamingStrategy</code></a>`。返回 `<code>String</code>` 的表达式在使用前会经过 `<a href=\"SqlIdentifierSanitizer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>sanitized</code></a>` 处理。此外，表达式也可以直接返回一个 `<a href=\"../sql/SqlIdentifier.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>SqlIdentifier</code></a>`，该标识符将原样使用，无需进一步清理。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The column name for id column in the corresponding relationship table. The attribute supports Value Expressions to\ndynamically obtain the column name on a per-operation basis. Defaults to <a href=\"NamingStrategy.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>NamingStrategy</code></a> usage if the value\nis empty. Expressions returning a <code>String</code> are <a href=\"SqlIdentifierSanitizer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>sanitized</code></a> prior usage.\nExpressions can also return a <a href=\"../sql/SqlIdentifier.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>SqlIdentifier</code></a> directly that is\nused as-is without further sanitization.",
      "translation": "对应关系表中 id 列的列名。该属性支持值表达式，以便在每次操作时动态获取列名。如果值为空，则默认使用<a href=\"NamingStrategy.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>NamingStrategy</code></a>接口。返回<code>String</code>的表达式在使用前会经过<a href=\"SqlIdentifierSanitizer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>sanitized</code></a>处理。此外，表达式也可以直接返回一个<a href=\"../sql/SqlIdentifier.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>SqlIdentifier</code></a>，该标识符将按原样使用，无需进一步清理。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The annotation to configure the mapping for a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a>, <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Set.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Set</code></a> or <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> property in the database.",
      "translation": "用于配置数据库中的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a>、<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Set.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Set</code></a> 或 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> 属性的映射的注解。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The column name for key columns of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a> or <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> collections in the corresponding relationship table.",
      "translation": "对应关系表中，用于存储 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a> 或 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>` 集合的关键列的列名。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The column name for id column in the corresponding relationship table.",
      "translation": "对应关系表中 id 列的列名。",
